<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details seeding to May 12.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details seeding to May 12.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of seeding progress to Monday May 12.</p>
<p>CROP				PCT SEEDED TO MAY 12</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat		42 pct</p>
<p>Canada Prairie Spring Wheat	38 pct</p>
<p>Soft White Spring Wheat	    83 pct</p>
<p>Durum Wheat			    71 pct</p>
<p>Oats				     15 pct</p>
<p>Barley				   32 pct</p>
<p>Flax				     17 pct</p>
<p>Canola				   24 pct</p>
<p>Total seeded acres		   35 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
